<title>JAPAN: Komatsu Seiren - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu Seiren - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.95		vs	   13.66</p>
<p> Operating	  758    million	  vs	  113    million</p>
<p> Current	    961    million	  vs	    1.24</p>
<p> Net		  520    million	  vs	  772    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.07 yen	  vs	   17.90 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     43 million	  vs	  43 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	 0.75 yen	  vs	    0.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Komatsu Seiren Co Ltd is a printer of long-staple fabrics.</p>
